<th id="S4.T1.5.1.5.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_row">REPRO-Agent</th>
<td id="S4.T1.5.1.5.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">36.6</td>
<td id="S4.T1.5.1.5.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">92.9</td>
<td id="S4.T1.5.1.5.4" class="ltx_td ltx_align_center">-</td>
